<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ohio Edison upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ohio Edison upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had upgraded its rating for Ohio Edison Co to near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The power company had been rated near- and long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
